00:20:40.920 --> 00:20:46.160
and electronic costs a month, give or take is&nbsp;
$250,000. Contractor, teammate cost is somewhere&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:20:46.160 --> 00:20:50.040
around one and a half million a month. So you&nbsp;
