some of the benefits from working with those&nbsp;
guys, just in terms of looking in the rear&nbsp;&nbsp;

03:52:34.300 --> 03:52:38.520
view mirror? Because I can think of a number&nbsp;
of coaches I've worked with it's like, "Oh,&nbsp;&nbsp;

03:52:38.520 --> 03:52:42.960
I picked up the whole body yes from that person,"&nbsp;
and that ended up being really important. And then&nbsp;&nbsp;

03:52:42.960 --> 03:52:47.960
you give another person, "Oh, okay, I took this&nbsp;
thing away from them and it was very valuable."&nbsp;&nbsp;

03:52:47.960 --> 03:52:51.080
