Noah Kagan: Let's take Ayman Al-Abdullah,&nbsp;&nbsp;

03:52:51.080 --> 03:52:56.319
for instance. I am going over 2024 strategy.&nbsp;
And so I talk to customers, I talk to partners,&nbsp;&nbsp;

03:52:56.319 --> 03:53:00.559
I talk to the team. We look at historically what&nbsp;
we've done and we put together a one-pager plan.&nbsp;&nbsp;

03:53:00.560 --> 03:53:05.200
One of the ideas is we have original products.&nbsp;
