a really powerful example of him just asking&nbsp;&nbsp;

03:54:02.439 --> 03:54:06.679
questions based on strategy and understanding&nbsp;
our business based on something I was like,&nbsp;&nbsp;

03:54:06.680 --> 03:54:09.560
"Here's what I'm thinking and here's my&nbsp;
problem. What should we do next year?" And&nbsp;&nbsp;

03:54:09.560 --> 03:54:13.160
then he's redirected me, and I think in a very&nbsp;
